.TH "intel_vbt_decode" "1" "2016-03-01" "igt-gpu-tools 2.5" "General Commands Manual"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
intel_vbt_decode \- Intel Video BIOS Table parser
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
\fBintel_vbt_decode\fP [\fIOPTIONS\fP]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
\fBintel_vbt_decode\fP is a tool to parse the Intel Video BIOS Tables (VBT) and
present the information in a human readable format.
.sp
The preferred ways of getting the binary VBT to parse are:
.INDENT 0.0
.IP 1. 3
/sys/kernel/debug/dri/0/i915_vbt (since kernel version 4.5)
.IP 2. 3
/sys/kernel/debug/dri/0/i915_opregion
.IP 3. 3
Using the \fBintel_bios_dumper(1)\fP tool.
.UNINDENT
.sp
The VBT consists of a VBT header, a BIOS Data Block (BDB) header, and a number
of BIOS Data Blocks.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.BI \-\-file\fB= FILE
Parse Video BIOS Tables from FILE.
.TP
.BI \-\-devid\fB= DEVID
Pretend to be PCI ID DEVID. Some details can be parsed more accurately if
the platform is known.
.TP
.BI \-\-panel\-type\fB= N
Parse the details for flat panel N. Usually this is retrieved from the Video
BIOS Tables, but this can be used to override.
.TP
.B  \-\-all\-panels
Parse the details for all flat panels present in the Video BIOS Tables.
.TP
.B  \-\-hexdump
Hex dump the blocks.
.TP
.BI \-\-block\fB= N
Dump only the BIOS Data Block number N.
.UNINDENT
.SH "گزارش باگ‌ها (REPORTING BUGS)"
.sp
Report bugs on fd.o GitLab: \%<https://\:gitlab\:.freedesktop\:.org/\:drm/\:igt-gpu-tools/\:-/\:issues>
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
